OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurder over stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a fatal stabbing in
OL,8,FBirmingham.
OL,10,FThe suspect, in his 20s, was detained
OL,11,Fwith two other men on Sunday night when
OL,12,Fofficers stopped a vehicle in
OL,13,FStaffordshire, West Midlands Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FIt came after a man in his 30s died in
OL,17,Fhospital on Friday, three days after he
OL,18,Fwas found with stab wounds on Ashville
OL,19,FAvenue in the Hodge Hill area of
OL,20,FBirmingham.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
